    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d630">

                <pb facs="0707" n="627" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg627"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Mr. Powell.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-08-12"><hi rendition="#italic">August 12,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 529.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I confirm herewith your telegram<anchor
                        n="a" xml:id="d630-f1"/> of the 9th instant. The information contained in it
                    has been communicated to the proper Departments, and they have been requested,
                    in case any infringement of the neutrality laws of the United States shall have
                    been brought to their notice, to take steps to enforce the due observance of the
                    obligations of neutrality imposed by them.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Alvey A. Adee</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
